From ba74420f074926601701dc2bf7a19bc402e0b34b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:41:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] native text: pieces rendered whole (tickets),
 window-resolution text overlay, area downscale, exact text mask

Sharp text draws the games' text itself: the drawers' calls are laid out with the font's advances and kerning and drawn as whole pieces (ga2_hitext::noteRun / runImage) the GS composes as tickets; the presentation takes the GS's rendering out of 2D pictures above 640x448 (text layer, per-PS2-pixel occlusion with an area vote, footprint filled from the surroundings) and draws each piece again at the window's resolution. A picture larger than the window is shrunk with an area filter; Anime4K's detail mix keeps the port's text areas as rendered.
---
 ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ga2_hitext.h |  73 +++-
 ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ga2_present.cpp      | 480 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 ps2xRuntime/src/lib/gs/gs_hitext.cpp     | 219 ++++++++++-
 ps2xRuntime/src/lib/gs/gs_texpacks.cpp   |  38 ++
 4 files changed, 790 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ga2_hitext.h b/ps2xRuntime/include/runtime/ga2_hitext.h
